          "marks": [],
          "text": ": Can you create structures for your interview types?"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d6f595355549",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "51333d178821",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Assess privacy requirements"
        },
        {
          "_key": "a025458b1ec4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ": Does transcript-only documentation meet your compliance needs?"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "209a89221a60",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "88d17847436b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Calculate ROI"
        },
        {
          "_key": "a2a664f98b2d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ": Does time saved justify $14/month Business upgrade for unlimited history?"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "379cfb79ae55",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4f87bd86f50e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Pricing and plans: When to upgrade"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "html0",
      "_type": "rawHtml",
      "html": "<table>\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 18%\" />\n<col style=\"width: 20%\" />\n<col style=\"width: 38%\" />\n<col style=\"width: 24%\" />\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Feature</th>\n<th>Basic (Free)</th>\n<th>Business ($14/user/mo)</th>\n<th>Enterprise ($35/user/mo)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Best for</strong></td>\n<td>Testing & current projects</td>\n<td>High-volume of meetings, unlimited search history, and advanced integrations</td>\n<td>Enterprise compliance</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>AI meeting notes</strong></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Meeting history</strong></td>\n<td>Limited</td>\n<td>Unlimited</td>\n<td>Unlimited</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Shared folders</strong></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Templates & Recipes</strong></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Advanced integrations</strong></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Advanced AI models</strong></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>SSO</strong></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Priority support</strong></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
    },
    {
      "_key": "5480306ca165",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c3d0268301d9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Upgrade to our Business plan ($14/user/month) when you need unlimited meeting history, CRM integrations (HubSpot, Attio, Affinity), or advanced AI thinking models. You'll also get centralized billing and user management."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "24903c6bb37a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9655b73f2c63",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Upgrade to our Enterprise plan ($35/user/month) when you need SSO, org-wide auto-deletion periods, priority support with a dedicated contact, or usage analytics."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4b90f1715440",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "851f0d7c5cee",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Get started with Granola today"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c3e81f389810",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0f204f437e88",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Download "
        },
        {
          "_key": "bcf09e725e4a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "7fd93e958a9e"
          ],
          "text": "Granola for Mac, Windows, or iOS"
        },
        {
          "_key": "4c61a2a5abb1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". Connect your calendar and run your first meeting. The Free plan never expires and includes unlimited meetings. When you need unlimited history or CRM integrations, upgrade to Business at $14/user/month."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "7fd93e958a9e",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://help.granola.ai/article/setting-up-granola-for-the-first-time"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "902edf87ca61",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a814dfebfe1a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Frequently asked questions"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0645c23dd6e3",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5b125421837e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Does Granola work on Windows?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ed8bb53282eb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Yes. We support macOS, Windows, and iOS."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00ba49f50e69",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "20c451005f0d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Do I need to invite a bot to my meetings?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "42c73964e89f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "No. Granola runs on your laptop or phone and uses your device's audio to generate notes. We recommend telling participants you're using Granola to take notes."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "40c336bb2b96",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "49126c5752ea",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Is my data used to train AI models?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "7783d4aa7081",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " All users can opt out of model training in settings."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "abb9aaddb135",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ba19a8a670e5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Does Granola record video?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00d6f0e9e969",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " No. We only transcribe audio. We don't create audio or video recordings."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "749333294248",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "05f5cbe29368",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "How long do I have access to meeting notes on the Free plan?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "039f24fe31bc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Limited meeting history. Older notes become inaccessible unless you export them."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d5f12b93386c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "46f12fe4df11",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Can I share notes with teammates on the Free plan?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "efed23fd3655",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Yes. Shared folders work on all plans, including Free."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "cf3d7041fd68",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a4cfcca1ae60",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "What happens to audio after meetings?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "9100b33b2f78",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " We transcribe audio then delete it. We only retain text transcripts."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f77ab165c283",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "fd483c30227e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Key terms glossary"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ef675a726f6f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c456d44b871d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Device audio capture:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "e8283db3330e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Granola runs on your laptop or phone and uses your device's microphone and system audio to generate notes."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7bd6655e4ebf",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "cd1758baa46d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Enhanced notes:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "be98308ae246",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " AI-generated additions to your rough notes, pulled from the meeting transcript. Your original notes stay in black; AI enhancements appear in gray so you can distinguish and edit them."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2d9f3ed01d5e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c42c4e67a8a5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Meeting history limit:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "649535d7e1d1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " The Free plan provides access to notes from the past 14 days. Older meetings become inaccessible unless exported before the limit."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ac003d631ebc",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "3232deea3f7a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Human-in-the-loop:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "665e7c2f7db0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " You jot what matters during the meeting. AI enhances your notes afterward with context from the transcript. This contrasts with full automation where AI decides what's important."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d43474f2e9cc",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a55b24780c7f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Recipes:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000bdc43b50b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Pre-built prompts for Granola Chat that process meeting content in specific ways, such as extracting feature requests or creating follow-up emails."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "951be561f873",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b506606da9fe",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Opt-out of model training:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "da3c22ff195b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " All users can disable AI model training on their data in settings. This prevents third-party providers from using your transcripts to improve their models."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    }
  ],
